{"id":"2d06636b21adf739","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md","title":"Biholomorphism","display":"df-biholomorphism — Biholomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-biholomorphism","aliases":["58-df-biholomorphism"],"display":"df-biholomorphism — Biholomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-biholomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-biholomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-biholomorphism — Biholomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f,g,m,n,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y,f,g,m,n,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\)</span>（复流形谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S\\)</span>（复图册谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的复线性映射谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^m\">\\(\\mathbb C^m\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^n\">\\(\\mathbb C^n\\)</span> 的全纯映射谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_X:X\\to X\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_X:X\\to X\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_Y:Y\\to Y\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_Y:Y\\to Y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（此处定义的复流形间全纯映射谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（此处定义的双全纯同构谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}complex\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S(A,m,n)\\leftrightarrow A:\\mathbb C^m\\to\\mathbb C^n\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^m\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(A(u+v)=A(u)+A(v)\\land A(\\lambda u)=\\lambda A(u)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}complex\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S(A,m,n)\\leftrightarrow A:\\mathbb C^m\\to\\mathbb C^n\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^m\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(A(u+v)=A(u)+A(v)\\land A(\\lambda u)=\\lambda A(u)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}on\\text{-}cmn} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S(h,D,m,n)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq\\mathbb C^m\\land h:D\\to\\mathbb C^n\\land\\forall z\\in D\\;\\exists A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S(A,m,n)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb C^m\\;\\bigl(0&lt;\\|u\\|&lt;\\delta\\land z+u\\in D\\to\\|h(z+u)-h(z)-A(u)\\|\\leq\\varepsilon\\|u\\|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}on\\text{-}cmn} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S(h,D,m,n)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq\\mathbb C^m\\land h:D\\to\\mathbb C^n\\land\\forall z\\in D\\;\\exists A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S(A,m,n)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb C^m\\;\\bigl(0&lt;\\|u\\|&lt;\\delta\\land z+u\\in D\\to\\|h(z+u)-h(z)-A(u)\\|\\leq\\varepsilon\\|u\\|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,m)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\exists\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A_X,X,\\tau_X,m)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_X\\;\\forall\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\bigl((\\psi\\circ f\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],\\phi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],m,n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,m)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\exists\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A_X,X,\\tau_X,m)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_X\\;\\forall\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\bigl((\\psi\\circ f\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],\\phi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],m,n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(g:Y\\to X\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(g,Y,\\tau_Y,n,X,\\tau_X,m)\\land g\\circ f=\\operatorname{id}_X\\land f\\circ g=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(g:Y\\to X\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(g,Y,\\tau_Y,n,X,\\tau_X,m)\\land g\\circ f=\\operatorname{id}_X\\land f\\circ g=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Biholomorphisms are isomorphisms in the category of complex manifolds.</li>\n<li>将逆映射作为量化见证可避免把尚未证明双射的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}\">\\(f^{-1}\\)</span> 当作预先存在的函数。</li>\n<li>上游的一元复分析谓词只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span>；此处显式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^m\\to\\mathbb C^n\">\\(\\mathbb C^m\\to\\mathbb C^n\\)</span> 的 Fréchet 复可微性，并补齐两个流形的拓扑参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S$（复流形谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S$（复图册谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,f,g,m,n,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_X:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_Y:Y\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}complex\\text{-}linear\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S(A,m,n)\\leftrightarrow A:\\mathbb C^m\\to\\mathbb C^n\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^m\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl(A(u+v)=A(u)+A(v)\\land A(\\lambda u)=\\lambda A(u)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}on\\text{-}cmn} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S(h,D,m,n)\\leftrightarrow D\\subseteq\\mathbb C^m\\land h:D\\to\\mathbb C^n\\land\\forall z\\in D\\;\\exists A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexLinearMap}_S(A,m,n)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathbb C^m\\;\\bigl(0<\\|u\\|<\\delta\\land z+u\\in D\\to\\|h(z+u)-h(z)-A(u)\\|\\leq\\varepsilon\\|u\\|\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}manifold\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau_X,m)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land\\exists\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A_X,X,\\tau_X,m)\\land\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A_Y,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land\\forall\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_X\\;\\forall\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\mathrm{HolomorphicOnCmn}_S\\bigl((\\psi\\circ f\\circ\\phi^{-1})\\upharpoonright\\phi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],\\phi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],m,n\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}biholomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(g:Y\\to X\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicManifoldMap}_S(g,Y,\\tau_Y,n,X,\\tau_X,m)\\land g\\circ f=\\operatorname{id}_X\\land f\\circ g=\\operatorname{id}_Y\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^m\\to\\mathbb C^n","display":false}],"bytes":3137,"backlinks":[{"id":"3315c3af8b987983","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Biholomorphism}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$, with order $(f,X,\\tau_X,m,Y,\\tau_Y,n)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"fb6604241f53b69a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-biholomorphism.md|58-df-biholomorphism]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["0ab38aca0c5161bb","36d7463d215be751"]}